== 6a. KILL SWITCH, level 1: gateway-wide lockdown (every sandbox, one command) ==
$ openshell policy set --global --policy demo/policies/lockdown.yaml --yes
✓ Global policy configured (hash: 1b621527d93a, settings revision: 15)
  -> oci-agent blocked after 6 s: HTTP 0: URLError: <urlopen error [Errno 13] Permission denied>
  -> oci-agent-2 blocked after 1 s: HTTP 0: URLError: <urlopen error [Errno 13] Permission denied>
[20:11:56] ok      #2: We're making great progress and everything is on track!
[20:12:01] ok      #3: We're making great progress and on track to meet our goals.

== 6b. ...and it is reversible: lift the lockdown ==
$ openshell policy delete --global --yes
